@startuml
title 小組加入、即時作答檢視與學習單匯入 - Join Opening, Presence and Live Answer Flow
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "Guided Notes Import Service" as Import
participant "Activity / Group Service" as Activity
participant "Buzzer Flow Service" as Buzzer
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Authenticated WebSocket / Presence Monitor" as Live
participant "Role-scoped Events" as Events
participant "Feature 004 Results" as Results

Teacher -> UI : import/replace worksheet while joining is closed
UI -> Import : request import
Import -> DB : confirm phase preparing and joiningOpenedAt is null
Import -> Import : recognize headers/merged structure; validate all rows
alt unique structure and valid question numbers
  Import -> DB : transaction: replace set, mappings, and display_order
  DB --> Import : committed document order and source numbers
else invalid numbers or ambiguous structure
  Import --> UI : sheet/row diagnostic; no partial writes
end

Teacher -> UI : press 開放加入
UI -> Activity : open team enrollment
Activity -> DB : validate teacher, preparing phase, ready questions
alt questions are ready
  Activity -> DB : atomic set joiningOpenedAt and lock question set
  DB --> Activity : committed open state; phase remains 準備中
  Activity -> Events : publish committed join/roster state
  Events --> UI : teacher sees authoritative join status
else questions are not ready
  Activity --> UI : reject; enrollment remains closed
end
Student -> UI : request to join
UI -> Activity : enroll using activity/group
Activity -> DB : require joiningOpenedAt, preparing phase, online capacity
DB --> Activity : commit membership and revisions
Activity -> Events : publish after commit
Events --> UI : authorized online count/join state
note over Student,UI : Keep the current team-formation screen; add no total-question count or question preview.

alt clean connection close
  Student -> Live : close connection cleanly
  Live -> Activity : mark offline immediately
else unclean network interruption
  Student -> Live : connection drops
  Live -> Live : wait 30 consecutive seconds without heartbeat
  Live -> Activity : classify offline
end
Activity -> DB : persist offline; apply phase-specific membership policy
DB --> Activity : commit online count and revisions
Activity -> Events : publish committed presence
group Activity : Phase behavior
  note over DB : Preparing after open: free vacancy; recover original role if space remains.
  note over DB : Answering: no new enrollment; existing reconnect is unlimited.
end

Student -> UI : submit answer during answering
UI -> Buzzer : submit answer for stored student identity
Buzzer -> DB : validate and persist first valid answer/rank
DB --> Buzzer : committed progress and revision
Buzzer -> Events : publish teacher-wide and own-team updates
Events --> UI : teacher counts, groups, answer, rank; own-team student view
note over Buzzer,Events
  After commit, authorized views render within 2s.
  Denominator includes offline groups; later valid teams retain subsequent rank.
end note

Teacher -> UI : end activity
UI -> Activity : transition to 已結束
Activity -> DB : commit ended phase and stable results
Student -> Results : read saved results if authorized
Teacher -> Results : review saved results
@enduml
